old Ctrl = Descend\n\nScripter: SnakeWorl\nBuilder: AfroDs\nSpanish Translation: Jeffreyubi","path":"/game/536102540-final-stand","slug":"536102540-final-stand","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/37f4a9cf01d66a4731701a780f912c235334302f59a61c95d8aa37244118f64c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7adf706ab821d0c60e648a00f2261d3f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":501751715,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-16T04:21:33.297Z","creator":{"name":"SnakeWorl","type":"User"},"script":{"count":11,"freeCount":11,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":76668493349114,"name":"💥SNIPE OR DIE [FPS]","desc":"💥SNIPE OR DIE is a FPS game where everyone uses a sniper... but every round you also get a random ability to help you win the round B)\n\n🎯Quickscope enemies\n✨Unlock new snipers\n🔃Use different abilities every round\n\n❗TIP: You MUST be fully scoped in to be accurate!\n\nCONTROLS - \nSwap To Melee/Weapon:\n💻 Q\n🎮 Y/△\nUse Scope:\n💻 Hold Right Click\n🎮 LT/L2\n\n📱Mobile Controls Are On Screen\n\nWant to practice your aim on noob bots? make a vip server :o\n\nThis game takes inspiration from many of my favorite games :)\n(id put the names but i dont want roblox to get mad)","path":"/game/76668493349114-snipe-or-die","slug":"76668493349114-snipe-or-die","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/07ae0cbd536752c7be010e87daad3df88e916e018faef1449f65e15c4d858e7e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a04dd60d9dce680dd0468801483d2f47/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":92685794,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-22T08:51:55.405Z","creator":{"name":"Chaseroony","type":"User"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":106525193781380,"name":"[MULTIPLE CARRY] 🗻 Mount Sibuatan","desc":"Welcome to Mount Sibuatan, a mountain located in North Sumatra, Indonesia, standing tall at over 2,457 meters above sea level. Explore the lush tropical forest, feel the cool mountain air, and roleplay your way through an immersive climbing journey!\n\n💡 Pantun time!\n\nMendaki gunung di pagi hari,\nAngin sejuk datang perlahan.\nSerunya naik Sibuatan ini,\nAjak teman biar lebih aman!\n","path":"/game/106525193781380-mount-sibuatan","slug":"106525193781380-mount-sibuatan","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3c17487dbfbbfeeb8dd1e8b41e84a2f6b6e43a0401b06152945ec18582e00591.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d226ee57ed2be0b83dde904678910405/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":21049577,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-22T09:42:16.972Z","creator":{"name":"Indossible","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":75203399886990,"name":"Mafia Clash","desc":"🔪Your family is at WAR! Four rival families are competing for control of your city's underworld. Whose side will you take? Will you be a simple grunt, rise through the ranks to become the boss, or fight them as a cop? 🔪\n\n⭐ CLAIM your COMMUNITY MEMBER role by joining the group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/35589408\n\n- 💰 Become the Boss and command real players to glory!\n- 🧑‍🏭 Climb the ranks of your family with over 11 unique classes!\n- ❤️ Steal and survive in a massive open world! \n- 👍 Enjoy the game? Leave a favorite and like to support the developers!\n\n💬Check out the Social Links below to learn more about our community!\n\n🏷️1930’s, Tommy gun, Shooter, Jail, Cops, Police, Heist, Robbery","path":"/game/75203399886990-mafia-clash","slug":"75203399886990-mafia-clash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d22ea00c833fe400cb3a0d380594937da94ad56bf7e10680e3368a9f5845ea23.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-30db657ecd7c7d218401566ebdf154a5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":3023639,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-02T13:18:18.263Z","creator":{"name":"Mafia Clash Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":118503840388689,"name":"[c00lkid] Surviv